Cell["\<\
The term s is adult survival. In the bracket, the first term is recruitment \
without dispersal and the second is recruitment after dispersal. At the \
resident state, all fecundities are equal and the three contributions add to \
one.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3140838f-db2c-40c1-acbc-69e1e55d40f4"]
}, Open  ]],

