Cell["\<\
Relatedness rises with adult survival when 0 < m < 1, and falls with \
dispersal and patch size. For s < 1, patchmates eventually belong to the same \
lineage when m = 0. Complete dispersal gives r2 = 0.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dde71f76-ee0a-4a1e-b599-2436ad651f33"]
}, Open  ]],

